<%--
Status_Badge - filled pill for a model enum workflow status

$model - model class name string (e.g. "Client_Model"); resolves the enum [required unless $label+$badge given]
$status_id - the enum value on the model's status field [required unless $label+$badge given]
$field="status_id" - the enum field name on the model [optional]
$label - explicit label override (skips the model lookup) [optional]
$badge - explicit badge class override, e.g. "bg-success" [optional]

Renders ONE filled, Bootstrap-colored status pill from the model's enum
`badge`/`label` mapping (the same convention `Model::$enums` declares). Pass
$label + $badge directly when the caller already has them precomputed (e.g. a
row payload that shipped `status__label` / `status__badge`).

$editable (a change-status popover) is intentionally NOT built: it is only
warranted where the entity has a real user-facing status-transition endpoint.
Clients have none, so a clickable status chip would imply an action that does
not exist. Add $editable in the batch that first converts an entity that can
legitimately change status inline.

Usage:
    <Status_Badge $model="Client_Model" $status_id=_client.status_id />
    <Status_Badge $label=row.status__label $badge=row.status__badge />
--%>
<Define:Status_Badge tag="span">
    <%
        let _label = this.args.label;
        let _badge = this.args.badge;
        const _has_value = this.args.status_id !== undefined && this.args.status_id !== null && this.args.status_id !== '';
        if ((_label === undefined || _badge === undefined) && this.args.model && _has_value) {
            const _field = this.args.field || 'status_id';
            const _model_class = Manifest.get_class_by_name(this.args.model);
            const _meta = _model_class ? _model_class[_field + '__enum'](this.args.status_id) : null;
            if (_meta) {
                if (_label === undefined) _label = _meta.label;
                if (_badge === undefined) _badge = _meta.badge;
            }
        }
        _badge = _badge || 'bg-secondary';
    %>
    <span class="badge <%= _badge %>"><%= _label %></span>
</Define:Status_Badge>
